|------|----------|
| Wave-1 floor | bare `println(tok)` / string no-FP / `eprintln(tok)` / `println(n, tok)` still **dual SECRET** |
| Live hole | `println((n), tok)` check **OK**; `println((("x")+tok))` emit-c **prints `tok`**; `eprintln(id(1), tok)` check **OK** |
| WT source | `c_emit_secret.oo` Int `depth` (check + `c_secret_scan_call`); `c_emit_print.oo` Int `d` (stmt scan) |
| Shipping ELF | `ooda/oodac/oodac` **962960** B @ 07:49 — **HEAD first-`RPAREN` stop**. Depth is **not** in this binary |
| Unify | stmt `println` still does **not** call `c_secret_emit_guard` (SPRINT wording). Wave-2 is **depth**, not that helper |
| DE2.9 table | still **false** — L175–200 is a token walk, not `c_secret_emit_guard(env, id, …)` |

