### Peer1 MUST rails (Docs Writer re-prove — `/tmp/s29b_docs_must`)

Expect refuse = rc≠0 + `ERR	secret` on **check and emit-c**.

| # | Shape | check | emit-c | Dual SECRET? |
|---|-------|-------|--------|--------------|
| 1 | `println((n), tok)` | rc=0 `OK` | rc=1 `ERR	secret` after `oo_print_int((n));` | **NO** |
| 2 | `println((("x")+tok))` | rc=1 `ERR	type` arity (no `ERR	secret`) | rc=0 **leak** `oo_print_*` of concat(`tok`) | **NO** |
| 3 | `eprintln(id(1), tok)` | rc=0 `OK` | rc=1 `ERR	secret` eprintln | **NO** |
| 4 | `println(n, tok)` | rc=1 `ERR	secret` | rc=1 same | **YES** |

Matches `audit/s29b_peer1.oot`. `ERR	type` is **not** a SECRET seal.

